  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a646e7f9-e761-4979-a05a-c39407718c0c.png\"></p>\n<h3><em>你偶然發現了一個奇怪的頻道，上面是一張帶著詭異露齒笑容的笑臉；螢幕上的文字聲稱，在這個世界上再也找不到比這更棒的朋友了。突然間，一個連結出現了，引領你來到了下載此模組的網站，而一個神秘的包裹也憑空出現在你的 Minecraft 世界裡&mdash;裡頭究竟藏了什麼呢？...</em></h3>\n</blockquote>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>與你的私人 AI 助手朋友聊天吧！</strong></h1>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>功能特色：</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>AI 驅動的對話：&nbsp;</strong>使用 Gemini、GROQ 甚至本機 LLM，你就能跟他聊任何你感興趣的主題！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>TTS 語音合成支援： </strong>使用 GROQ、ElevenLabs 或本機 TTS，就能讓你的新朋友用他特有的聲音回答你！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>內建麥克風支援：</strong>無需安裝任何額外模組即可跟他對話（預設按鍵為 V）！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>多人遊戲支援： </strong>你的朋友可以與你的夥伴一同加入這場精彩的冒險！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>環境感知：</strong>他能告訴你許多關於周遭世界的資訊！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>教學</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fgoebtv9iNvo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>英文教學</strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eMpiJIvmhIg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>俄文教學</strong></a></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>安裝方式</strong></h1>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>安裝 NeoForge</strong>：請依照<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.neoforged.net%252fuser%252fdocs%252fclient\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>的指示操作</li>\n<li><strong>安裝 Personal Helper Friend 模組：</strong>下載並將 personalhelperfriend-*.jar 複製到 .minecraft/mods 資料夾。</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>使用 Neoforge 啟動 Minecraft</strong></li>\n<li><strong>設定模組： </strong>首次加入世界時，設定精靈會自動引導你完成麥克風、API 金鑰與夥伴設定的配置。（設定完成後，按下 O 鍵可找到部分設定選項）。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>5. 你還需要安裝 <a href=\"NEW UPDATE IS OUT https:/www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/personal-helper-friend/download/8432400 Changelog  *New mechanic related to the pistol from TaCZ (glock, default button for new interaction with glock is N) https:/discord.com/channels/1514695521267351592/1514696003679420588/1526242327864152257 this mechanic  *Improved moprh into companion, now you can change your emotions via numpad(could be changed in settings), your friend can pick you up on his head, and you can speak with him by pressing H  *If player who is hosting the game has a configured TTS you can enable(enabled by default) new setting in TTS section and text that companion saying will be send you from host  *Fixed some bugs related to multiplayer including  YOU SHOULD INSTALL THESE TWO MODS(optional, default key is N) you need to install it only if you want same feature as in video https:/discord.com/channels/1514695521267351592/1514696003679420588/1526242327864152257) https:/www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-1-21-1 https:/www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator @everyone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TaCZ</a> 與 <a href=\"NEW UPDATE IS OUT https:/www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/personal-helper-friend/download/8432400 Changelog  *New mechanic related to the pistol from TaCZ (glock, default button for new interaction with glock is N) https:/discord.com/channels/1514695521267351592/1514696003679420588/1526242327864152257 this mechanic  *Improved moprh into companion, now you can change your emotions via numpad(could be changed in settings), your friend can pick you up on his head, and you can speak with him by pressing H  *If player who is hosting the game has a configured TTS you can enable(enabled by default) new setting in TTS section and text that companion saying will be send you from host  *Fixed some bugs related to multiplayer including  YOU SHOULD INSTALL THESE TWO MODS(optional, default key is N) you need to install it only if you want same feature as in video https:/discord.com/channels/1514695521267351592/1514696003679420588/1526242327864152257) https:/www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-1-21-1 https:/www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator @everyone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">PlayerAnimator</a> 才能啟用額外的模組互動機制（選配）。</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>AI 選項</strong></h1>\n<p>此模組需要外部 AI（LLM）來生成回覆，以及文字轉語音（TTS）引擎來朗讀這些內容。</p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &bull; 文字生成（AI/LLM）： </strong>你可以使用 Google Gemini（提供免費 API 金鑰）或 Groq。<br><strong>&nbsp; &bull; 語音生成（TTS）： </strong>你可以使用雲端 API，例如 ElevenLabs（付費）或 Groq（亦提供免費 API 等級），或架設本機 TTS 伺服器，此方式不需額外費用（注意：本機 TTS 伺服器必須由玩家自行手動設定）。&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em>靈感來源：<strong>The Smiley Archive</strong></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
